msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:70
msgid ""
"HEAT GmbH, which operates this website, takes the protection of your "
"personal data very seriously. We treat your personal data confidentially in "
"accordance with statutory data protection regulations and this Data Privacy "
"Statement."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:73
msgid ""
"Any personal data (for example name, address or email address) that is "
"collected on our website is collected on a voluntary basis insofar as this "
"is possible. This data will not be disclosed to any third party without your "
"express consent."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:76
msgid ""
"Please note that data transmission via the internet (e.g., in the case of "
"communication by email) may be subject to security gaps. It is not possible "
"to protect such data completely against access by third parties."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:85
msgid "Purpose of Data Collection, Processing, or Use"
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:87
msgid ""
"In the context of the Webtool, personal data is used to respond to requests "
"or inquiries, customize the site for users (e.g. show locationally relevant "
"information), operate and improve the site, including usage analysis and "
"audits, protection against fraud, spam, harassment, intellectual property "
"infringement, crime and security risks, and to maintain and improve the "
"safety and security of the site."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:95
msgid "Description of Affected Groups and Their Related Data"
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:97
msgid ""
"Within the context of the Registration and Use of the Webtool, basic "
"personal User information is collected, consisting of an email address, "
"username, and voluntary city-level location information. Additionally, "
"individuals without registration might submit personal information through "
"support requests."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:105
msgid "Standard Periods for the Deletion of Data"
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:107
msgid ""
"Personal data is deleted on a regular basis when it is no longer needed to "
"fulfill a contract, if the person in question has not provided their "
"separate approval to retain said data or if statutory retention obligations "
"and deadlines do not stipulate that data be retained for a longer period."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:115
msgid "Planned Transmission of Data to Third Countries"
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:117
msgid ""
"In general, no personal data will be transmitted to third countries by "
"electronic means. Exceptions to this are possible when there is a specific "
"legal basis for such a transmission."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:125
msgid "Your Rights"
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:128
msgid ""
"You may at any time request information about the use of your personal data "
"(according to § 15 DSGVO) or request the verification, correction or "
"deletion of your personal data (§§ 16 and 17 DSGVO). You may also at any "
"time request the restriction of the use or processing of your personal data "
"(§§ 18 and 19 DSGVO), request the transmission of your personal data to "
"third parties (§ 20 DSGVO), or object to the use of your personal data (§ 21 "
"DSGVO)."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:132
msgid ""
"If you want to exercise any of the above-mentioned rights, please send an "
"email to:\n"
"            <a href=\"mailto:datenschutz@gfa-group.de\" class=\"link link-"
"primary font-semibold hover:underline\">datenschutz@gfa-group.de</a>.\n"
"            We will endeavor to take the necessary measures as soon as "
"possible. To that purpose, you will receive an access form to be completed, "
"allowing you to indicate which rights you wish to exercise with regard to "
"your personal data."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\compliance\privacy_policy.html:138
msgid ""
"You also have the right to file a complaint against the use of your personal "
"data. The competent complaints board is the Data Protection Supervisory "
"Authority (Datenschutzaufsichtsbehörde) of Hessen."
msgstr ""

